   "prompt": "Write a condensed structural formula, such as CH<sub>3</sub>CH<sub>3</sub>, and describe the molecular geometry at each carbon atom.<br>(a) 2-propanol<br>(b) acetone<br>(c) dimethyl ether<br>(d) acetic acid<br>(e) 3-methyl-1-hexene",
   "answer": {
